Package: seabiRds
Type: Package
Title: Prepares biologging data for analysis and upload to the lab database
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Allison Patterson
Maintainer: Allison Patterson <allison.patterson@mail.mcgill.ca>
Description: Provides tools for standardizing biologging data and importing it into the Arctic Ecology Lab
    biologging database. Imports GPS, time-depth recorder and accelerometer data from Axy-trek, Cattrack,
    Ecotone and LAT2800 loggers as standardized parquet datasets, and provides functions for working with
    GPS and accelerometer data.
URL: https://github.com/allisonglider/seabiRds
BugReports: https://github.com/allisonglider/seabiRds/issues
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
